div.p:
Among NATO-related arrangements and facilities,
                    the study indicates that Greece places importance on the following: 

—[1 line not declassified];

—participation in the NATO
                            intelligence and communication system;

—continued participation in NATO’s
                            infrastructure program;

—membership in the NATO Military
                            Committee;

—participation in the full range of NATO planning; and



—retention of specific facilities such as airfields, naval bases,
                            command and control facilities, and certain NATO training sites.
